-- Goods and Services Tax Act 1993 — TESTS.
-- Expected values are worked from ../source/GSTA1993.txt, not from the code.

§ `Tests`

§§ `Helpers`

-- a local supply of services, invoiced and paid on given dates
GIVEN taxable IS A BOOLEAN, business IS A BOOLEAN, paid IS A BOOLEAN, amount IS A NUMBER, ex IS AN `Exempt category`, zr IS A `Zero-rating ground`, inv IS A MAYBE DATE, rec IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A Supply
`local services` taxable business paid amount ex zr inv rec MEANS
    Supply OF `services`, `not removed from or to Singapore, and in Singapore`, `a business or fixed establishment only in Singapore`, taxable, business, paid, amount, ex, zr, `general (s 11(2))`, inv, rec, NOTHING, FALSE, FALSE

`a plain supply` MEANS `local services` TRUE TRUE TRUE 1090 `none` `none` (JUST (YMD 2024 3 15)) NOTHING

GIVEN k IS A `Supply kind`, mv IS A `Goods movement`, e IS AN Establishment, seventh IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Supply
`a supply of` k `moving` mv `by` e `, Seventh Schedule:` seventh MEANS
    Supply OF k, mv, e, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 1000, `none`, `none`, `general (s 11(2))`, NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, seventh, FALSE

GIVEN rule IS A `Time-of-supply rule`, inv IS A MAYBE DATE, rec IS A MAYBE DATE, done IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A Supply
`timed by` rule `, invoice` inv `, paid` rec `, performed` done MEANS
    Supply OF `goods`, `not removed from or to Singapore, and in Singapore`, `a business or fixed establishment only in Singapore`, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 1000, `none`, `none`, rule, inv, rec, done, FALSE, FALSE

GIVEN services IS A BOOLEAN, belongs IS A BOOLEAN, registered IS A BOOLEAN, private IS A BOOLEAN, full IS A BOOLEAN, excluded IS A BOOLEAN, elected IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Reverse charge facts`
`reverse charge` services belongs registered private full excluded elected MEANS
    `Reverse charge facts` OF services, FALSE, belongs, registered, private, full, excluded, elected

GIVEN business IS A BOOLEAN, attributable IS A BOOLEAN, arrangement IS A BOOLEAN, knew IS A BOOLEAN, risk IS A BOOLEAN, reasonable IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Input tax facts`
`input` business attributable arrangement knew risk reasonable MEANS
    `Input tax facts` OF business, 100, attributable, arrangement, knew, risk, reasonable

GIVEN last IS A NUMBER, next IS A NUMBER, satisfied IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Registration facts`
`a local business with` last `last year,` next `expected, Comptroller satisfied:` satisfied MEANS
    `Registration facts` OF TRUE, last, next, satisfied, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, TRUE

GIVEN global IS A NUMBER, seventh IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Registration facts`
`an overseas vendor with` global `global and` seventh `Seventh Schedule supplies last year` MEANS
    `Registration facts` OF FALSE, 0, 0, FALSE, global, seventh, 0, 0, 0, 0, TRUE

GIVEN received IS A NUMBER, full IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Registration facts`
`a recipient of` received `in reverse charge services, full credit:` full MEANS
    `Registration facts` OF TRUE, 0, 0, FALSE, 0, 0, 0, 0, received, 0, full

§§ `Goal 1 — where and whether tax is charged`

#ASSERT `belongs in Singapore` `a business or fixed establishment only in Singapore`
#ASSERT NOT `belongs in Singapore` `a business or fixed establishment only abroad`
#ASSERT `belongs in Singapore` `no establishment; usual residence in Singapore`
#ASSERT NOT `belongs in Singapore` `establishments in Singapore and abroad; the one most concerned is abroad`
#ASSERT `the supply is made in Singapore` (`a supply of` `services` `moving` `not removed from or to Singapore, and in Singapore` `by` `a business or fixed establishment only in Singapore` `, Seventh Schedule:` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the supply is made in Singapore` (`a supply of` `services` `moving` `not removed from or to Singapore, and in Singapore` `by` `a business or fixed establishment only abroad` `, Seventh Schedule:` FALSE)
#ASSERT `the supply is made in Singapore` (`a supply of` `goods` `moving` `removed from Singapore` `by` `a business or fixed establishment only abroad` `, Seventh Schedule:` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the supply is made in Singapore` (`a supply of` `goods` `moving` `removed to Singapore` `by` `a business or fixed establishment only in Singapore` `, Seventh Schedule:` FALSE)
#ASSERT `the tax treatment of` `a plain supply` EQUALS `standard-rated`
#ASSERT `the tax treatment of` (`local services` TRUE TRUE TRUE 1090 `residential land or property (para 2)` `none` NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS `exempt`
#ASSERT `the tax treatment of` (`local services` TRUE TRUE TRUE 1090 `none` `international services under s 21(3)` NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS `zero-rated`
#ASSERT `the tax treatment of` (`local services` TRUE TRUE FALSE 0 `none` `none` NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS `outside the scope of the tax`
#ASSERT `the tax treatment of` (`local services` FALSE TRUE TRUE 1090 `none` `none` NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS `outside the scope of the tax`
#ASSERT `the tax treatment of` (`local services` TRUE FALSE TRUE 1090 `none` `none` NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS `outside the scope of the tax`
-- s 8(1A): an overseas supplier's Seventh Schedule supply is charged
#ASSERT `the tax treatment of` (`a supply of` `services` `moving` `not removed from or to Singapore, and in Singapore` `by` `a business or fixed establishment only abroad` `, Seventh Schedule:` TRUE) EQUALS `standard-rated`
-- Second Schedule para 5(2): gifts up to $200 and samples
#ASSERT NOT `the transfer of business goods is a supply, gift:` TRUE `, cost` 200 `, sample:` FALSE
#ASSERT `the transfer of business goods is a supply, gift:` TRUE `, cost` 201 `, sample:` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the transfer of business goods is a supply, gift:` FALSE `, cost` 5000 `, sample:` TRUE
-- Second Schedule para 7(1)(c): deemed supply on deregistration over $10,000
#ASSERT NOT `goods are deemed supplied on deregistration, value` 10000 `, transferred or carried on:` FALSE
#ASSERT `goods are deemed supplied on deregistration, value` 10001 `, transferred or carried on:` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `goods are deemed supplied on deregistration, value` 50000 `, transferred or carried on:` TRUE

