§§ `The top-level goal`

-- a $1,090 local supply of services invoiced on 15 March 2024
`case A` MEANS `the GST position for` (`Supply case` OF `a plain supply`, `none`, NOTHING)
#ASSERT `case A`'s `treatment` EQUALS `standard-rated`
#ASSERT `case A`'s `time of supply` EQUALS JUST (YMD 2024 3 15)
#ASSERT `case A`'s `rate per cent` EQUALS JUST 9
#ASSERT `case A`'s `tax on the supply` EQUALS JUST 90
#ASSERT NOT `case A`'s `the recipient accounts under the reverse charge`
-- a used car sold for $10,900 in 2024: value $10,000, halved
`case B` MEANS `the GST position for` (`Supply case` OF (`local services` TRUE TRUE TRUE 10900 `none` `none` (JUST (YMD 2024 6 1)) NOTHING), `a used motor vehicle (Third Schedule para 14)`, NOTHING)
#ASSERT `case B`'s `tax on the supply` EQUALS JUST 450
-- an export: zero-rated, no tax
`case C` MEANS `the GST position for` (`Supply case` OF (`local services` TRUE TRUE TRUE 5000 `none` `goods exported` (JUST (YMD 2024 6 1)) NOTHING), `none`, NOTHING)
#ASSERT `case C`'s `treatment` EQUALS `zero-rated`
#ASSERT `case C`'s `tax on the supply` EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT NOT `case C`'s `the recipient accounts under the reverse charge`
-- a partly exempt registrant buys $10,000 of services from an overseas supplier in 2024:
-- s 14(2) reverse charge; s 17(3A), (2A)(a) tax added on top — $900
`case D` MEANS `the GST position for` (`Supply case` OF (Supply OF `services`, `not removed from or to Singapore, and in Singapore`, `a business or fixed establishment only abroad`, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, 10000, `none`, `none`, `general (s 11(2))`, (JUST (YMD 2024 6 1)), NOTHING, NOTHING, FALSE, FALSE), `none`, (JUST (`reverse charge` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)))
#ASSERT `case D`'s `treatment` EQUALS `standard-rated`
#ASSERT `case D`'s `tax on the supply` EQUALS JUST 900
#ASSERT `case D`'s `the recipient accounts under the reverse charge`
